  "contentHtml": "\n<main>\n<section class=\"behind-hero\"><img alt=\"NIGHT 비하인드 기록\" class=\"behind-hero-image\" src=\"assets/images/behind/full/01-agency.webp\"/><div class=\"behind-hero-shade\"></div><div class=\"behind-hero-copy container\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">OFFICIAL BEHIND ARCHIVE</p><h1>BEHIND<br/><span>THE NIGHT</span></h1><p>THE MOMENTS BETWEEN THE STAGES.</p><div class=\"behind-rec\"><i></i> REC · NIGHT CAM</div><a href=\"#daily\">OPEN THE ARCHIVE ↓</a></div></section>\n<nav aria-label=\"비하인드 챕터\" class=\"behind-nav\"><div class=\"container\"><a href=\"#daily\">01 DAILY NIGHT</a><a href=\"#schedule\">02 ON SCHEDULE</a><a href=\"#offstage\">03 OFF THE STAGE</a><a href=\"#nightoff\">04 NIGHT OFF</a><a href=\"#members\">05 MEMBERS ONLY</a></div></nav>\n\n<section class=\"behind-chapter section\" id=\"daily\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"behind-head reveal\"><div><span>FILE 01</span><h2>Daily Night</h2></div><p>ORDINARY HOURS, UNFORGETTABLE MOMENTS.</p></div><div class=\"behind-grid\">\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/01-agency.webp\" data-title=\"DAILY NIGHT · AT CASTLE\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"소속사 앞에 모인 NIGHT\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/01-agency.webp\"/><span><b>AT CASTLE</b><small>START OF THE DAY</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/02-cafeteria.webp\" data-title=\"DAILY NIGHT · CAFETERIA\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"구내식당의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/02-cafeteria.webp\"/><span><b>CAFETERIA</b><small>LUNCH BREAK</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/03-mealtime.webp\" data-title=\"DAILY NIGHT · MEALTIME\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"함께 식사하는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/03-mealtime.webp\"/><span><b>MEALTIME</b><small>TOGETHER</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/04-ihwan-cooking.webp\" data-title=\"DAILY NIGHT · IHWAN'S KITCHEN\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"요리하는 이환\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/04-ihwan-cooking.webp\"/><span><b>IHWAN'S KITCHEN</b><small>CHEF OF THE DAY</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/05-lounge-rest.webp\" data-title=\"DAILY NIGHT · LOUNGE\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"라운지에서 쉬는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/05-lounge-rest.webp\"/><span><b>LOUNGE</b><small>SHORT BREAK</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/06-battery-empty.webp\" data-title=\"DAILY NIGHT · BATTERY EMPTY\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"방전된 NIGHT 멤버들\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/06-battery-empty.webp\"/><span><b>BATTERY EMPTY</b><small>STILL ROLLING</small></span></button>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"behind-chapter section\" id=\"schedule\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"behind-head reveal\"><div><span>FILE 02</span><h2>On Schedule</h2></div><p>BEFORE THE LIGHTS TURN ON.</p></div><div class=\"behind-grid\">\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/additions/full/infinity-monitoring.webp\" data-title=\"INFINITY 촬영 모니터링\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"INFINITY 촬영 모니터링 크게 보기\"><img alt=\"INFINITY 촬영 모니터링\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/additions/thumbs/infinity-monitoring.webp\"/><span><b>INFINITY 촬영 모니터링</b><small>BEHIND LOG</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/additions/full/airport-lounge.webp\" data-title=\"공항 라운지\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"공항 라운지 크게 보기\"><img alt=\"공항 라운지\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/additions/thumbs/airport-lounge.webp\"/><span><b>공항 라운지</b><small>BEHIND LOG</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind