\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/12-rest.webp\" data-title=\"ON SCHEDULE · REST\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"스케줄 사이 휴식 중인 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/12-rest.webp\"/><span><b>REST</b><small>BETWEEN SCHEDULES</small></span></button>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"behind-chapter section\" id=\"offstage\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"behind-head reveal\"><div><span>FILE 03</span><h2>Off the Stage</h2></div><p>THE SHOW ENDS. THE CAMERA KEEPS ROLLING.</p></div><div class=\"behind-grid\">\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/additions/full/after-wings-shoot.webp\" data-title=\"WINGS 촬영 후\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"WINGS 촬영 후 크게 보기\"><img alt=\"WINGS 촬영 후\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/additions/thumbs/after-wings-shoot.webp\"/><span><b>WINGS 촬영 후</b><small>BEHIND LOG</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/additions/full/after-concert.webp\" data-title=\"콘서트 후 뒤풀이\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"콘서트 후 뒤풀이 크게 보기\"><img alt=\"콘서트 후 뒤풀이\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/additions/thumbs/after-concert.webp\"/><span><b>콘서트 후 뒤풀이</b><small>BEHIND LOG</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/additions/full/after-editorial-shoot.webp\" data-title=\"화보 촬영 후\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"화보 촬영 후 크게 보기\"><img alt=\"화보 촬영 후\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/additions/thumbs/after-editorial-shoot.webp\"/><span><b>화보 촬영 후</b><small>BEHIND LOG</small></span></button>\n\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/13-waterbomb.webp\" data-title=\"OFF THE STAGE · WATERBOMB\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"워터밤 무대를 마친 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/13-waterbomb.webp\"/><span><b>WATERBOMB</b><small>AFTER THE SHOW</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/14-summer-rain.webp\" data-title=\"OFF THE STAGE · SUMMER RAIN\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"소나기를 맞은 NIGHT 멤버들\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/14-summer-rain.webp\"/><span><b>SUMMER RAIN</b><small>FIVE IN THE RAIN</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/15-doha-after-rain.webp\" data-title=\"AFTER THE RAIN · DOHA\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"비를 닦고 있는 도하\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/15-doha-after-rain.webp\"/><span><b>DOHA</b><small>AFTER THE RAIN</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/16-woohyun-wet-hair.webp\" data-title=\"AFTER THE RAIN · WOOHYUN\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"젖은 머리를 털고 있는 우현\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/16-woohyun-wet-hair.webp\"/><span><b>WOOHYUN</b><small>AFTER THE RAIN</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/17-ihwan-after-rain.webp\" data-title=\"AFTER THE RAIN · IHWAN\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"물기를 짜내는 이환\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/17-ihwan-after-rain.webp\"/><span><b>IHWAN</b><small>AFTER THE RAIN</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/18-taehoon-blanket.webp\" data-title=\"AFTER THE RAIN · TAEHOON\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"담요를 두르고 있는 태훈\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/18-taehoon-blanket.webp\"/><span><b>TAEHOON</b><small>KEEPING WARM</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/19-jiwoo-changing.webp\" data-title=\"OFF THE STAGE · JIWOO\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"무대 의상을 갈아입는 지우\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/19-jiwoo-changing.webp\"/><span><b>JIWOO</b><small>QUICK CHANGE</small></span></button>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"behind-chapter section\" id=\"nightoff\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"behind-head reveal\"><div><span>FILE 04</span><h2>Night Off</h2></div><p>NO STAGE. NO SCRIPT. JUST NIGHT.</p></div><div class=\"behind-grid\">\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/20-bathhouse.webp\" data-title=\"NIGHT OFF · BATHHOUSE\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"목욕탕을 찾은 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/20-bathhouse.webp\"/><span><b>BATHHOUSE</b><small>NIGHT OFF</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/21-jjimjilbang.webp\" data-title=\"NIGHT OFF · JJIMJILBANG\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"찜질방에서 쉬는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/21-jjimjilbang.webp\"/><span><b>JJIMJILBANG</b><small>REST MODE</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/22-changing-room.webp\" data-title=\"NIGHT OFF · CHANGING ROOM 01\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"탈의실의 NIGHT 첫 번째 기록\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/22-changing-room.webp\"/><span><b>CHANGING ROOM</b><small>FILE 01</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/23-changing-room-2.webp\" data-title=\"NIGHT OFF · CHANGING ROOM 02\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"탈의실의 NIGHT 두 번째 기록\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/23-changing-room-2.webp\"/><span><b>CHANGING ROOM</b><small>FILE 02</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/24-jiwoo-window.webp\" data-title=\"NIGHT OFF · JIWOO BY THE WINDOW\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"창가에 앉은 지우\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/24-jiwoo-window.webp\"/><span><b>JIWOO</b><small>BY THE WINDOW</small></span></button>\n</div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"behind-chapter section\" id=\"members\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"behind-head reveal\"><div><span>FILE 05</span><h2>Members Only</h2></div><p>FIVE MEMBERS. ZERO QUIET MOMENTS.</p></div><div class=\"behind-grid\">\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/additions/full/doha.webp\" data-title=\"DOHA 비하인드\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"DOHA 비하인드 크게 보기\"><img alt=\"DOHA 비하인드\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/additions/thumbs/doha.webp\"/><span><b>DOHA 비하인드</b><small>BEHIND LOG</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/additions/full/woohyun.webp\" data-title=\"WOOHYUN 비하인드\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"WOOHYUN 비하인드 크게 보기\"><img alt=\"WOOHYUN 비하인드\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/additions/thumbs/woohyun.webp\"/><span><b>WOOHYUN 비하인드</b><small>BEHIND LOG</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/additions/full/jiwoo.webp\" data-title=\"JIWOO 비하인드\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"JIWOO 비하인드 크게 보기\"><img alt=\"JIWOO 비하인드\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/additions/thumbs/jiwoo.webp\"/><span><b>JIWOO 비하인드</b><small>BEHIND LOG</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/additions/full/ihwan.webp\" data-title=\"IHWAN 비하인드\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"IHWAN 비하인드 크게 보기\"><img alt=\"IHWAN 비하인드\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/additions/thumbs/ihwan.webp\"/><span><b>IHWAN 비하인드</b><small>BEHIND LOG</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/additions/full/taehoon.webp\" data-title=\"TAEHOON 비하인드\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"TAEHOON 비하인드 크게 보기\"><img alt=\"TAEHOON 비하인드\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/additions/thumbs/taehoon.webp\"/><span><b>TAEHOON 비하인드</b><small>BEHIND LOG</small></span></button>\n\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/25-doha-woohyun.webp\" data-title=\"MEMBERS ONLY · DOHA & WOOHYUN\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"도하와 우현의 비하인드\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/25-doha-woohyun.webp\"/><span><b>DOHA × WOOHYUN</b><small>MEMBERS ONLY</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo behind-wide reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/26-jiwoo-taehoon.webp\" data-title=\"MEMBERS ONLY · JIWOO & TAEHOON\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"지우와 태훈의 비하인드\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/26-jiwoo-taehoon.webp\"/><span><b>JIWOO × TAEHOON</b><small>MEMBERS ONLY</small></span></button>\n</div><div class=\"behind-reaction-head reveal\"><span>ONE KISS, FOUR REACTIONS</span><p>태훈의 갑작스러운 애정 표현 직후, 카메라에 남은 네 사람의 반응.</p></div><div class=\"behind-reaction-grid\">\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/27-kiss-reaction-doha.webp\" data-title=\"ONE KISS, FOUR REACTIONS · DOHA\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"태훈이 뽀뽀한 직후 도하의 반응\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/27-kiss-reaction-doha.webp\"/><span><b>DOHA</b><small>REACTION 01</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/28-kiss-reaction-woohyun.webp\" data-title=\"ONE KISS, FOUR REACTIONS · WOOHYUN\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"태훈이 뽀뽀한 직후 우현의 반응\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/28-kiss-reaction-woohyun.webp\"/><span><b>WOOHYUN</b><small>REACTION 02</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/29-kiss-reaction-jiwoo.webp\" data-title=\"ONE KISS, FOUR REACTIONS · JIWOO\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"태훈이 뽀뽀한 직후 지우의 반응\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/29-kiss-reaction-jiwoo.webp\"/><span><b>JIWOO</b><small>REACTION 03</small></span></button>\n<button class=\"behind-photo reveal\" data-full=\"assets/images/behind/full/30-kiss-reaction-ihwan.webp\" data-title=\"ONE KISS, FOUR REACTIONS · IHWAN\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"태훈이 뽀뽀한 직후 이환의 반응\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/behind/thumbs/30-kiss-reaction-ihwan.webp\"/><span><b>IHWAN</b><small>REACTION 04</small></span></button>\n</div><div class=\"behind-ending reveal\"><span>END OF FILE</span><strong>THE CAMERA STOPS.<br/>THE NIGHT GOES ON.</strong></div></div></section>\n</main>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-label=\"비하인드 이미지 확대 보기\" aria-modal=\"true\" class=\"behind-lightbox\" id=\"behindLightbox\" role=\"dialog\"><button aria-label=\"닫기\" class=\"behind-lightbox-close\" type=\"button\">×</button><button aria-label=\"이전 이미지\" class=\"behind-lightbox-nav behind-lightbox-prev\" type=\"button\">‹</button><div class=\"behind-lightbox-stage\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"behind-lightbox-image\" src=\"\"/><div class=\"behind-lightbox-meta\"><span class=\"behind-lightbox-title\"></span><span class=\"behind-lightbox-index\"></span></div></div><button aria-label=\"다음 이미지\" class=\"behind-lightbox-nav behind-lightbox-next\" type=\"button\">›</button></div>\n",
